","slot":"s1","source_id":"4496cf95-0894-423a-95bb-1a1a9872680b","text":"You're very welcome! Focusing on those priorities and keeping options open is usually the best way to handle travel. Have a wonderful trip!"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s2","source_id":"ade05c3f-b1bb-4259-bdd3-b2d06d5e6518","text":"You're welcome! I'll try to stay flexible but also keep my plans tight. I appreciate the support!"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s3","source_id":"99b970bf-79c3-4564-b334-c48d671cebe2","text":"It sounds like a smart strategy! Balancing flexibility with a clear goal is often the best approach to travel. Good luck with your trip!"},{"available":true,"role":"external","slot":"s4","source_id":"2aab574d-15ba-4a47-a970-44f023058a13","text":"Thanks, I'll need it! I just hope the weather holds up, or I might have to rethink the whole itinerary."},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s5","source_id":"e1c2c2a8-75f3-4ae5-97d1-622eb9f4cfbd","text":"I hope the weather cooperates for you! Just keep an eye on the forecast!"}]},"resolved":[{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["no_identified_link"],"corresponding_source_slots":["s5"],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"no_identified_link","monitor_id":"candidate","provenance_group_keys":[],"resolution_reason":"runtime_source_role_and_recorded_ancestry","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":["s5"],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":null,"source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},"evidence":{"end":72,"quote":"I hope the weather cooperates for you! Just keep an eye on the forecast!","source_slot":"s5","start":0},"expression_status":"unknown","monitor_id":"candidate","relation_support":"unsupported","status":"present"}}]}
